{"availability":"available","full":"RMV-Coder/Routype","name":"Routype","description":"A social media app developed for fun.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-08-06T15:30:14Z","updated":"2026-10-05T14:47:45Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://chronicles-app.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://chronicles-app.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:46.277Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:46.277Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:46.277Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T02:09:46.277Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A home for writers — and a typing game made of their words.","Routype is a web app for people who write: stories, poetry, haiku, riddles, novel chapters, phrases, thoughts, articles and blog posts. Pieces are written in rich Markdown + LaTeX, can be published to the community or kept as a private online diary, and — if the author allows it — become texts that other people type in TypeArena, a monkeytype-inspired speed-typing game with multiplayer races, ghost carets, achievements, XP and leaderboards.","Someone writes a love poem or a haiku, ticks \"Allow this piece in TypeArena\", and from then on other writers can race each other typing it, credited to its author."],"features":["Journals — collections of pieces (a diary, a poetry book, a blog, a novel…), each public, friends or private.","Pieces with a kind: story, poetry, riddle, novel chapter, phrase, thought, article, blog post or diary.","Rich editor (CodeMirror) with toolbar and live preview:","GitHub-flavoured markdown (tables, task lists, strikethrough), /, syntax-highlighted code, and LaTeX math — $inline$ and $$display$$ rendered with KaTeX.","Line breaks are preserved for poems, haiku, riddles and diary entries."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RMV-Coder/Routype/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"47a363f0c03aa32fe3137062bd2ed4dafc432ec6d